<title>FINLAND: Finnish Sept export prices fall 0.5 pct mth/mth - SF.</title>
<headline>Finnish Sept export prices fall 0.5 pct mth/mth - SF.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish markka-denominated export prices fell 0.5 percent in September on August and they fell 3.2 percent year-on-year, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>			Sept 1996	  August 1996   Sept 1995</p>
<p> Mth/mth	     -0.5 pct	    -1.2 pct	+1.3 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr		 -3.2 pct	    -1.5 pct	+7.3 pct</p>
<p>Markka-denominated import prices rose 0.5 percent</p>
<p>month-on-month in September and they rose 2.0 percent</p>
<p>year-on-year, SF said.</p>
<p>			Sept 1996	    August 1996   Sept 1995</p>
<p> Mth/mth	     +0.5 pct	    -0.7 pct	0.0 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr		 +2.0 pct	    +1.5 pct     -0.7 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
